1
00:00:09,045 --> 00:00:13,258
Notice a thought. Now notice that
"a thought" has been picked out.

2
00:00:13,338 --> 00:00:17,841
This, rather than the sound in the
room or the feeling in the chest.

3
00:00:18,649 --> 00:00:23,763
This is After Anatta: notes by
John Tan, known as Thusness.

4
00:00:24,594 --> 00:00:26,743
People often expect me to say it.

5
00:00:26,823 --> 00:00:32,381
Anatta is seen, the witness is gone,
and what remains is vivid appearing,

6
00:00:32,461 --> 00:00:34,080
clear and knowing.

7
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,240
So why not simply call that mind?

8
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:39,614
Why not say that mind is
the empty vivid appearing?

9
00:00:40,438 --> 00:00:42,614
Because mind too is singled out.

10
00:00:42,694 --> 00:00:45,766
It is picked out as
"this", and designated.

11
00:00:45,846 --> 00:00:50,820
To say "mind is the appearing" takes one
thing that was singled out and makes it

12
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:55,019
the name of everything that
appears. That move looks harmless.

13
00:00:55,099 --> 00:00:57,872
It is the same move that
once made the Witness,

14
00:00:57,952 --> 00:00:59,788
the Source and the Mirror.

15
00:00:59,868 --> 00:01:02,469
The cut is quietly promoted to the whole.

16
00:01:03,277 --> 00:01:05,194
So I do not give mind that place.

17
00:01:05,274 --> 00:01:08,142
Not because mind is less than appearances.

18
00:01:08,222 --> 00:01:10,792
Because nothing singled
out gets that place.

19
00:01:10,872 --> 00:01:15,443
Not mind, not matter, not
clarity, and not emptiness.

20
00:01:16,265 --> 00:01:18,132
Start with what singling out is.

21
00:01:18,933 --> 00:01:21,244
Designation does not need words.

22
00:01:21,324 --> 00:01:23,350
It needs only singling out.

23
00:01:23,430 --> 00:01:27,797
This sound, this colour, this
ache, picked out as "this".

24
00:01:27,968 --> 00:01:31,271
A "this" stands out only
against what it is not,

25
00:01:31,351 --> 00:01:36,652
and only with this seeing, this light,
this attention, these conditions.

26
00:01:36,732 --> 00:01:40,121
In a world of only blue,
no one would see blue.

27
00:01:40,934 --> 00:01:45,243
So singling out is not something done
to an appearance that was there first.

28
00:01:45,323 --> 00:01:50,284
It is the appearing. And because it is
already dependence, it is already empty.

29
00:01:50,364 --> 00:01:53,748
By appearing, a thing is already empty.

30
00:01:53,828 --> 00:01:55,746
That is about what appearing is.

31
00:01:55,826 --> 00:01:57,648
It is not how it seems to us.

32
00:01:57,728 --> 00:02:00,868
To us, things seem to stand by themselves.

33
00:02:00,948 --> 00:02:04,025
That seeming is the habit,
and we will come to it.

34
00:02:04,829 --> 00:02:09,953
Most people agree with this, as long as
we talk about apples, sounds and tables.

35
00:02:10,032 --> 00:02:14,178
The trouble starts when we turn the same
seeing on the one who seems to be doing

36
00:02:14,258 --> 00:02:15,528
the singling out.

37
00:02:16,329 --> 00:02:19,632
Mind is not standing
outside the act, doing it.

38
00:02:19,712 --> 00:02:21,914
Mind is one of the things singled out.

39
00:02:21,994 --> 00:02:25,574
If you ask who, then,
does the singling out:

40
00:02:25,663 --> 00:02:27,376
no one stands behind it.

41
00:02:27,456 --> 00:02:31,235
The act, what is singled out
and the mind arise together,

42
00:02:31,315 --> 00:02:36,683
the way the doer and the deed arise
together in Nāgārjuna's eighth chapter.

43
00:02:36,763 --> 00:02:40,098
A singler standing behind
would be the witness again.

44
00:02:40,909 --> 00:02:45,244
Mind is picked out as "this
knowing", "this thought", "my mind".

45
00:02:45,324 --> 00:02:49,524
And like every "this", it stands
out only with its conditions.

46
00:02:49,604 --> 00:02:53,071
Its characteristics and its
behaviour are not its own.

47
00:02:53,151 --> 00:02:56,984
They depend on all the other
factors in that act of singling out,

48
00:02:57,064 --> 00:03:00,589
and they fit the framework in
which mind is being singled out.

49
00:03:01,409 --> 00:03:03,611
Look at how differently mind is cut.

50
00:03:03,691 --> 00:03:07,701
In everyday talk, mind is
my thoughts and my feelings,

51
00:03:07,781 --> 00:03:12,008
something inside the head
that I own, calm or upset.

52
00:03:12,088 --> 00:03:17,416
In the Abhidharma, mind is a run of
mind-moments with their mental factors,

53
00:03:17,496 --> 00:03:19,372
counted and classified.

54
00:03:19,452 --> 00:03:23,149
In Yogācāra, mind is
eight consciousnesses:

55
00:03:23,229 --> 00:03:28,244
six for the senses, one that takes
them as "I", and a storehouse.

56
00:03:28,324 --> 00:03:32,456
In neuroscience, mind is
brain activity: networks,

57
00:03:32,536 --> 00:03:34,974
signals and measurable states.

58
00:03:35,781 --> 00:03:39,410
Each of these works. A friend
can comfort with the first.

59
00:03:39,490 --> 00:03:42,712
A meditator can train with
the second and the third.

60
00:03:42,792 --> 00:03:44,899
A doctor can treat with the fourth.

61
00:03:44,979 --> 00:03:48,065
But none of them is mind
as it is from its own side,

62
00:03:48,145 --> 00:03:50,470
because no such mind is found.

63
00:03:50,550 --> 00:03:56,140
In each framework, mind behaves exactly
as that framework's cut requires.

64
00:03:56,966 --> 00:03:59,903
That is what I mean when
I say mind is designated.

65
00:03:59,983 --> 00:04:02,362
It does not mean mind is a mere word.

66
00:04:02,442 --> 00:04:05,663
It means that what we
call mind, its edges,

67
00:04:05,743 --> 00:04:11,424
its unity and its properties, arises
together with the act that singles it out,

68
00:04:11,504 --> 00:04:13,494
and is not found apart from it.

69
00:04:14,322 --> 00:04:15,886
The same holds the other way.

70
00:04:15,966 --> 00:04:20,547
Matter is not stuff standing by
itself, with mind floating on top.

71
00:04:20,627 --> 00:04:25,452
A table is singled out as "this
table" by eye, hand and use.

72
00:04:25,532 --> 00:04:31,077
A physicist singles it out as molecules,
then fields, then probabilities.

73
00:04:31,157 --> 00:04:35,384
The cook, the chemist and the physicist
cut the same loaf differently,

74
00:04:35,464 --> 00:04:37,082
and each cut works.

75
00:04:37,162 --> 00:04:39,722
None of them is the
loaf from its own side.

76
00:04:40,521 --> 00:04:43,892
Once both are seen this
way, an old puzzle loosens.

77
00:04:43,972 --> 00:04:48,199
The Hard Problem asks how matter,
complete without experience,

78
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:50,033
could give rise to mind.

79
00:04:50,113 --> 00:04:54,449
But the question begins by taking
two cuts within one vivid appearing,

80
00:04:54,529 --> 00:04:57,302
and treating each as standing on its own.

81
00:04:57,382 --> 00:04:59,585
Then it asks for a bridge between them.

82
00:04:59,665 --> 00:05:04,114
No bridge is found, because the
gap was made by the starting point.

83
00:05:04,946 --> 00:05:07,095
One caution about the word "cut".

84
00:05:07,175 --> 00:05:12,425
The appearing is never found uncut,
waiting for a framework to slice it.

85
00:05:12,555 --> 00:05:14,866
"One appearing" means "not two".

86
00:05:14,946 --> 00:05:18,172
It does not mean a whole
lying underneath its parts.

87
00:05:18,990 --> 00:05:23,367
So I do not say all is mind,
and I do not say all is matter.

88
00:05:23,447 --> 00:05:28,503
They are not two things to be joined,
and not one thing in two disguises.

89
00:05:28,583 --> 00:05:31,505
They are two ways the
appearing is singled out,

90
00:05:31,585 --> 00:05:33,344
each within its framework.

91
00:05:34,162 --> 00:05:39,381
So mind, consciousness and luminous
clarity are the same in this respect.

92
00:05:39,461 --> 00:05:44,408
They are phenomena. A phenomenon is
whatever can be known. Mind can be known.

93
00:05:44,488 --> 00:05:46,243
Consciousness can be known.

94
00:05:46,323 --> 00:05:47,914
Clarity can be known.

95
00:05:47,994 --> 00:05:52,157
So they are dependently arisen,
and empty like everything else.

96
00:05:52,982 --> 00:05:57,631
This needs care, because I also
say that clarity is never absent.

97
00:05:57,711 --> 00:06:00,837
You cannot talk about
phenomena without clarity.

98
00:06:00,917 --> 00:06:04,383
Every appearing is clear,
known as it appears.

99
00:06:04,463 --> 00:06:09,496
Dependent arising is never a mechanism
in the dark that a knower then lights up.

100
00:06:10,314 --> 00:06:14,636
But "never absent" means never
absent from what appears.

101
00:06:14,716 --> 00:06:17,694
It does not mean an awareness
that stays switched on.

102
00:06:17,774 --> 00:06:22,408
Under anaesthesia, when the conditions
for the six streams are not met,

103
00:06:22,488 --> 00:06:26,131
nothing appears, and no
clarity is left over,

104
00:06:26,211 --> 00:06:27,915
waiting in the dark.

105
00:06:28,713 --> 00:06:33,836
And clarity being never absent is not
the same as clarity being the floor.

106
00:06:33,916 --> 00:06:39,217
Its sameness across sights, sounds
and thoughts is easily lifted out,

107
00:06:39,297 --> 00:06:42,654
and taken to stand on
its own, as a background,

108
00:06:42,734 --> 00:06:45,182
or a Mind that gives off appearances.

109
00:06:45,262 --> 00:06:49,054
Not lifted out, the clarity
stays the appearing's own.

110
00:06:49,134 --> 00:06:53,596
Lifted out and held, it becomes
the last refuge of the self.

111
00:06:54,397 --> 00:06:58,692
So I put it this way. Clarity is
never missing from what appears.

112
00:06:58,772 --> 00:07:01,599
And the moment clarity
is picked out and named,

113
00:07:01,679 --> 00:07:03,447
it is one more phenomenon.

114
00:07:03,527 --> 00:07:06,291
Not the thing all phenomena are made of.

115
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:09,938
There was a very key
phase in my own insight.

116
00:07:10,018 --> 00:07:14,191
It was the recognition that
appearances are one's radiance clarity.

117
00:07:14,271 --> 00:07:18,131
It came between phase four,
Presence as a bright mirror,

118
00:07:18,211 --> 00:07:23,407
and phase five, no mirror
reflecting, when anatta became clear.

119
00:07:24,213 --> 00:07:25,804
It is a direct taste.

120
00:07:25,884 --> 00:07:29,500
Appearances are not out
there, reflected in a mirror.

121
00:07:29,580 --> 00:07:34,758
They are luminous, vivid and intimate,
and the distance between knower and known

122
00:07:34,838 --> 00:07:37,914
collapses. I do not deny any of it.

123
00:07:38,726 --> 00:07:42,981
But it misses something, and at the time
I did not know that it was being expressed

124
00:07:43,061 --> 00:07:47,564
vaguely, inside the old
framework. Listen to the words.

125
00:07:47,694 --> 00:07:49,298
"One's" keeps an owner.

126
00:07:49,378 --> 00:07:54,516
The appearances belong to someone, even
if that someone has become very large and

127
00:07:54,596 --> 00:07:55,796
very subtle.

128
00:07:55,900 --> 00:07:59,054
"Radiance" pictures a source
and what it gives off.

129
00:07:59,134 --> 00:08:03,678
And "clarity" quietly becomes the
stuff that appearances are made of.

130
00:08:04,506 --> 00:08:09,209
So the taste was non-dual, but the
framework reading it was still inherent.

131
00:08:09,289 --> 00:08:12,198
This was the first
desynchronisation I met:

132
00:08:12,278 --> 00:08:13,910
the taste ahead of the view.

133
00:08:13,990 --> 00:08:16,967
One moment the taste
is vivid and complete.

134
00:08:17,047 --> 00:08:20,201
The next, the mind
tries to say what it is,

135
00:08:20,281 --> 00:08:23,828
and what it says is
contradictory and untenable,

136
00:08:23,908 --> 00:08:27,089
exactly as Nāgārjuna's analysis shows.

137
00:08:27,169 --> 00:08:31,994
A mind that lights its own appearances
is the lamp of his seventh chapter.

138
00:08:32,074 --> 00:08:37,714
A clarity that is the source of everything
is the self-standing cause of his first.

139
00:08:37,794 --> 00:08:40,504
The taste was not wrong. Its reading was.

140
00:08:41,313 --> 00:08:45,023
Many practices work by
quieting the symbolic layer.

141
00:08:45,103 --> 00:08:50,282
Dropping labels, suspending thought,
resting without elaboration.

142
00:08:50,362 --> 00:08:53,841
Bare attention, bare
awareness, naked awareness.

143
00:08:53,921 --> 00:08:55,526
I do not dismiss this.

144
00:08:55,606 --> 00:09:00,363
Letting go of concepts does allow
a direct taste of luminous clarity,

145
00:09:00,443 --> 00:09:03,914
and of its non-duality with
what we call appearances.

146
00:09:04,730 --> 00:09:06,349
But I see it for what it is.

147
00:09:06,429 --> 00:09:09,161
Bare attention is one
part of the training:

148
00:09:09,241 --> 00:09:12,245
learning to taste
luminous clarity directly.

149
00:09:12,325 --> 00:09:17,123
Tasting appearances as one's radiance
clarity is another insight again.

150
00:09:17,203 --> 00:09:20,642
And for those who break through
to a direct taste of anatta,

151
00:09:20,722 --> 00:09:23,387
in my view that whole course is completed.

152
00:09:23,467 --> 00:09:28,427
Once there is no seer behind seeing, there
is nothing left to strip away to reach the

153
00:09:28,507 --> 00:09:31,489
seeing. In seeing, only the seen.

154
00:09:32,297 --> 00:09:37,203
What quieting the symbolic layer does not
do is resolve the distorted view that led

155
00:09:37,283 --> 00:09:41,374
to the confusion. When thought
returns, and it always does,

156
00:09:41,454 --> 00:09:44,051
the same framework reads the taste again.

157
00:09:44,131 --> 00:09:46,089
The clarity becomes a ground.

158
00:09:46,169 --> 00:09:49,282
The presence becomes
a universal substance.

159
00:09:49,362 --> 00:09:53,141
The openness becomes a field
from which appearances emerge.

160
00:09:53,221 --> 00:09:55,804
The habit was never only in the words.

161
00:09:55,884 --> 00:10:00,274
Singling out happens before language,
and so does the habit of taking what is

162
00:10:00,354 --> 00:10:02,882
singled out as standing on its own.

163
00:10:02,962 --> 00:10:06,216
Quieting words does not
reach it. Seeing it does.

164
00:10:07,029 --> 00:10:11,405
So concepts are not the enemy,
and silence is not the cure.

165
00:10:11,485 --> 00:10:13,882
The cure is understanding the habit.

166
00:10:14,689 --> 00:10:19,812
So what is needed after anatta is not more
bare attention. It is work on the view.

167
00:10:19,892 --> 00:10:24,273
In my own case it went in stages,
and it goes round more than once.

168
00:10:25,153 --> 00:10:27,151
First, anatta itself.

169
00:10:27,231 --> 00:10:29,271
In seeing, only the seen.

170
00:10:29,351 --> 00:10:31,540
There is thinking, and no thinker.

171
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:34,461
But anatta removes the one who watches.

172
00:10:34,541 --> 00:10:37,573
It does not by itself
remove the things watched,

173
00:10:37,653 --> 00:10:40,711
the moment, the space they seem to sit in,

174
00:10:40,791 --> 00:10:43,053
or the causes that seem to drive them.

175
00:10:43,857 --> 00:10:46,236
So the next stage is a strange one.

176
00:10:46,316 --> 00:10:50,149
The same pattern as the radiance
phase, one level deeper.

177
00:10:50,229 --> 00:10:53,192
The experience has become
non-substantialist,

178
00:10:53,272 --> 00:10:56,915
but the framework that reads
it is still substantialist.

179
00:10:56,995 --> 00:11:00,421
The self has dissolved,
but the universe has not.

180
00:11:00,501 --> 00:11:02,336
Space sits as a container.

181
00:11:02,416 --> 00:11:04,320
Time runs like a conveyor belt.

182
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:09,904
And awareness, or presence, or energy,
quietly becomes a subtle ground.

183
00:11:09,984 --> 00:11:12,187
The danger is that it feels complete.

184
00:11:12,267 --> 00:11:16,594
Then "this is beyond concepts"
becomes a reason not to look.

185
00:11:17,413 --> 00:11:19,751
Then refining and syncing the view.

186
00:11:19,831 --> 00:11:23,420
Get familiar with the logic
and the tools of dismantling:

187
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:26,857
the search for what is
designated, the four corners,

188
00:11:26,937 --> 00:11:29,371
the steps of the Logic After Anatta.

189
00:11:29,451 --> 00:11:32,767
Not as beliefs to hold,
but as tools to use,

190
00:11:32,847 --> 00:11:36,603
wherever the mind assumes that
something stands by itself.

191
00:11:37,409 --> 00:11:40,811
Catch the framework while
it is working. Take sadness.

192
00:11:40,941 --> 00:11:44,530
"My mind is heavy"
arrives as one solid fact:

193
00:11:44,610 --> 00:11:46,840
a mind, and its heaviness.

194
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:51,011
Look at what is actually there.
A weight in the chest. A sinking.

195
00:11:51,091 --> 00:11:55,209
A thought replaying. A face that
comes to mind. Each is vivid.

196
00:11:55,289 --> 00:11:58,379
None is the mind those words
placed underneath them.

197
00:11:58,523 --> 00:12:03,298
"My mind" was the cut that tied them
together and took itself as found.

198
00:12:04,101 --> 00:12:06,779
Then taste relaxing into openness.

199
00:12:06,859 --> 00:12:09,211
This is not bare attention coming back.

200
00:12:09,291 --> 00:12:12,431
Bare attention strips things
away to reach a seeing.

201
00:12:12,511 --> 00:12:17,322
Relaxing lets go of a holding that the
tools have already shown to be unfounded.

202
00:12:17,402 --> 00:12:19,999
Nothing is reached, and nothing is kept.

203
00:12:20,079 --> 00:12:22,096
Maintenance would be the split again.

204
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:27,341
This takes time, because we are
so used to the inherent framework.

205
00:12:27,421 --> 00:12:30,878
It does not give way to one
argument or one good sitting.

206
00:12:31,685 --> 00:12:35,314
And in time, the veil
dissipates with clear seeing.

207
00:12:35,394 --> 00:12:39,308
It is not torn away, and nothing
hidden is found behind it.

208
00:12:39,388 --> 00:12:42,352
The veil was the habit
of seeing inherently,

209
00:12:42,432 --> 00:12:46,442
and as the seeing becomes
clear, it loosens by itself.

210
00:12:46,522 --> 00:12:51,768
Appearing presents itself: no
maker, no knower, no background.

211
00:12:51,848 --> 00:12:53,901
That is spontaneous perfection.

212
00:12:53,981 --> 00:12:57,284
Mind and matter lose their
weight, and become light,

213
00:12:57,364 --> 00:12:59,354
magical and plastic.

214
00:13:00,153 --> 00:13:02,546
None of this is a state that is kept.

215
00:13:02,626 --> 00:13:07,736
It is recognised, and recognised again
wherever the habit still returns.

216
00:13:07,816 --> 00:13:11,690
Without the tools, the taste
is read back into a ground.

217
00:13:11,770 --> 00:13:14,398
Without the taste, the tools stay dry.

218
00:13:15,218 --> 00:13:16,945
So two things work together.

219
00:13:17,025 --> 00:13:22,040
The habit: by default we see inherently,
and whatever is singled out is taken as

220
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:26,171
there by itself. We designate
that habit as ignorance.

221
00:13:26,251 --> 00:13:31,266
And the framework, the matrix: the way
the appearing is broken into parts,

222
00:13:31,346 --> 00:13:35,519
mind and matter, subject and
object, cause and effect,

223
00:13:35,599 --> 00:13:39,871
for explanation and for use,
within a set of agreements.

224
00:13:40,673 --> 00:13:43,826
The matrix is not a field
beneath appearances.

225
00:13:43,906 --> 00:13:48,405
It is the framework itself, and the
habit of taking its cuts as found.

226
00:13:48,485 --> 00:13:50,796
The trouble is never that we single out.

227
00:13:50,876 --> 00:13:54,424
Singling out is the
appearing, vivid and exact.

228
00:13:54,504 --> 00:13:57,902
The trouble is that we take the
framework's cuts as the joints of the

229
00:13:57,982 --> 00:13:59,182
world.

230
00:13:59,613 --> 00:14:01,775
How does this stand with Nāgārjuna?

231
00:14:01,855 --> 00:14:06,521
That mind is designated like everything
else is his twenty-fourth chapter:

232
00:14:06,692 --> 00:14:11,557
whatever arises dependently is
empty, with no exception for mind.

233
00:14:11,637 --> 00:14:16,992
And Candrakīrti told the Mind-Only school
that you cannot keep the mind and throw

234
00:14:17,072 --> 00:14:20,842
out the objects. Searched
for, neither is found.

235
00:14:21,649 --> 00:14:24,313
And with Dzogchen, read without a ground?

236
00:14:24,393 --> 00:14:29,327
Longchenpa says the ground is called a
ground only from a relative point of view.

237
00:14:29,407 --> 00:14:33,448
Refusing to make clarity the
floor is Dzogchen's own warning.

238
00:14:34,253 --> 00:14:37,732
On one question my reading
is closer to Mahāmudrā.

239
00:14:37,812 --> 00:14:43,194
I keep the distinction between ordinary
mind and rigpa, but I hold it this way.

240
00:14:43,274 --> 00:14:46,890
Ordinary mind is appearing
held by the habit of fixing.

241
00:14:46,970 --> 00:14:50,328
Rigpa is the same appearing
known without that fixing.

242
00:14:50,408 --> 00:14:52,651
One mind, held two ways.

243
00:14:52,731 --> 00:14:57,434
Gampopa put it this way:
co-emergent mind is the truth body,

244
00:14:57,514 --> 00:15:00,373
and co-emergent appearances are its light.

245
00:15:01,185 --> 00:15:04,719
Dzogchen separates the two
more sharply, and rightly,

246
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:09,298
because a calm, clear ordinary
mind can pass for rigpa.

247
00:15:09,378 --> 00:15:13,496
But separating them is discerning,
not finding two things.

248
00:15:13,576 --> 00:15:18,283
And once rigpa is singled out
and named, it too is designated.

249
00:15:19,093 --> 00:15:24,434
This links to what I have long said:
spontaneous presence is dependent arising.

250
00:15:24,514 --> 00:15:27,600
In the appearing itself,
they are not even two.

251
00:15:27,680 --> 00:15:32,382
Dependent arising is the appearing
described while the dividing is at work:

252
00:15:32,462 --> 00:15:35,820
this condition, that
condition, this result.

253
00:15:35,900 --> 00:15:40,512
Spontaneous presence is the same
appearing when the fixing stops:

254
00:15:40,601 --> 00:15:44,121
already complete, with nothing
found that produces it.

255
00:15:44,201 --> 00:15:49,411
One appearing, described two ways,
at the same time. Neither is higher.

256
00:15:50,225 --> 00:15:52,685
In practice, they can come in an order.

257
00:15:52,765 --> 00:15:56,001
Often the tools come
first, and the taste after.

258
00:15:56,081 --> 00:15:58,763
Here Dōgen's firewood and ash fit.

259
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:01,653
Firewood is complete in its own position.

260
00:16:01,733 --> 00:16:04,166
Ash is complete in its own position.

261
00:16:04,246 --> 00:16:06,531
Neither is a lesser stage of the other.

262
00:16:06,611 --> 00:16:11,204
So I do not say that dependent
arising becomes spontaneous presence,

263
00:16:11,284 --> 00:16:13,949
any more than we say
summer becomes winter.

264
00:16:14,029 --> 00:16:16,358
Nothing crosses from one to the other.

265
00:16:17,181 --> 00:16:19,737
And each refines our reading of the other.

266
00:16:19,817 --> 00:16:24,900
Without dependent arising, spontaneous
presence is heard as a source,

267
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:28,201
a ground giving off
appearances from nowhere.

268
00:16:28,281 --> 00:16:33,554
Without spontaneous presence, dependent
arising is heard as a mechanism,

269
00:16:33,634 --> 00:16:36,136
a web of causes running in the dark.

270
00:16:36,216 --> 00:16:38,586
Together, they keep each other honest.

271
00:16:39,398 --> 00:16:41,157
Two guards, to end.

272
00:16:41,287 --> 00:16:44,101
"Vivid empty appearing"
is singled out too.

273
00:16:44,181 --> 00:16:47,226
If I do not mark that, it
becomes the next floor,

274
00:16:47,306 --> 00:16:51,931
a quieter name for the Mind I just
set down. And nothing is lost.

275
00:16:52,034 --> 00:16:56,139
Thinking, remembering, feeling
and choosing work as they did.

276
00:16:56,219 --> 00:16:59,454
The brain still matters.
Medicine still helps.

277
00:16:59,534 --> 00:17:03,258
What is denied is only a mind
standing on its own side,

278
00:17:03,338 --> 00:17:05,260
and a matter that does the same.

279
00:17:06,077 --> 00:17:10,222
Try it. Notice a thought, and
see that it has been singled out.

280
00:17:10,302 --> 00:17:12,912
Now notice the mind
that knows the thought.

281
00:17:12,992 --> 00:17:14,760
That too has been singled out.

282
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:16,459
Look for it apart from that.

283
00:17:16,539 --> 00:17:19,670
Then do the same with
this hand, and this table.

284
00:17:20,481 --> 00:17:24,450
And if a sense of luminous presence
comes, do not push it away.

285
00:17:24,530 --> 00:17:28,064
Ask only: is this clarity
standing on its own,

286
00:17:28,144 --> 00:17:29,803
behind what appears?

287
00:17:29,883 --> 00:17:32,810
Or is it the appearing's
own, and empty too?

288
00:17:33,626 --> 00:17:38,265
Then let go of the holding, and rest,
without trying to keep anything.

